migrate.description:
Pstryk AiO is installed. This integration can take over its API key and its entities, so they keep their entity IDs, names and history and nothing has to be typed in again.

Taken over ({taken_count}): {taken}

Removed, with no use here (the first hour of tomorrow; all hours of tomorrow are in the attributes of the price sensors): {removed}

AiO entities this integration does not know (left alone; "remove" deletes them together with AiO): {other}

AiO is stopped first: both read the same Pstryk API, which allows 3 requests per hour.

