Entities taken over from Pstryk AiO (ids, names and history kept): {taken}

Removed: {removed}

Pstryk AiO is disabled. Do not enable it again: it would create duplicates and use up the API limit. You can remove it in Settings > Devices & services and uninstall it in HACS.

